#: src/lib/guide-provider.js
#, ai
msgid "‘Amir ibn Fuhayrah and the guide went with them when they continued, and the guide led them by the coastal way. The guide’s personal name and the precise route are not established here."
msgstr "‘Amir ibn Fuhayrah da jagoran sun tafi tare da su lokacin da suka ci gaba da tafiya, kuma jagoran ya bi da su ta hanyar gabar teku. Ba a nuna sunan jagoran ko takamaiman hanyar da aka bi a nan ba."

#: src/lib/guide-provider.js
#, ai
msgid "‘Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr brought news of plans against them after darkness and returned to Makkah before daybreak."
msgstr "‘Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr ya riƙa kawo musu labaran shirye-shiryen da ake yi da su bayan duhu ya yi, kuma ya koma Makkah kafin alfijir ya hudo."

#: src/lib/guide-provider.js
#, ai
msgid "‘Amir ibn Fuhayrah tended the flock and brought milk near the cave during the three nights."
msgstr "‘Amir ibn Fuhayrah ya yi kiwon tumaki kuma ya kawo madara kusa da kogon a cikin darare ukun."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "post-hackathon publication review"
msgstr "bita kan wallafa bayan taron hackathon"

