msgstr "Turath · littafi na {0} · shafi na {1} · juzu'i na {2}, shafi na {3}"

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "draft — Turath page retrieved; scholarly and publication review pending"
msgstr "tsari na farko — an samo shafin Turath; ana jiran bitar masana da ta wallafawa"

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "draft — scholarly and publication review pending"
msgstr "tsari na farko — ana jiran bitar masana da ta wallafawa"

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "‘Amir ibn Fuhayrah provided another kind of help. He tended sheep and brought them near after nightfall, making milk available. The account describes this on each of the three nights."
msgstr "‘Amir ibn Fuhayrah ya ba da wani nau'in taimakon. Ya yi kiwon tumaki kuma ya kawo su kusa bayan duhu ya yi, ta yadda za a sami madara. Wannan bayani ya siffanta hakan a kowane dare na darare ukun."

