#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "Leaving Makkah"
msgstr "Barin Makkah"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "Night of 27 Safar · 12–13 September 622"
msgstr "Daren 27 Safar · 12–13 Satumba 622"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "The night of departure is in the accounts. Its place in the calendar is a modern reckoning."
msgstr "Daren tashi yana cikin ruwayoyin. Matsayinsa a cikin kalanda lissafi ne na zamani."

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "The nights before Friday, Saturday and Sunday"
msgstr "Darurukan da suka gabaci Jumma'a, Asabar da Lahadi"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "Three nights is in al-Bukhari. Naming them after the days of the week follows a modern reckoning."
msgstr "Daruruka uku suna cikin littafin al-Bukhari. Sanya musu suna da kwanakin mako ya biyo bayan lissafi ne na zamani."

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "The guide arrives"
msgstr "Jagora ya iso"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "Night of Monday, 1 Rabi‘ al-Awwal · 16 September 622"
msgstr "Daren Litinin, 1 Rabi‘ al-Awwal · 16 Satumba 622"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "The guide came with the two mounts after the third night, as arranged. The calendar date is a modern reckoning."
msgstr "Jagoran ya zo da dabbobin hawa guda biyu bayan dare na uku, kamar yadda aka tsara. Kwanan watan kalanda lissafi ne na zamani."

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "On the coastal road"
msgstr "A kan hanyar teku"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "About a week"
msgstr "Kusan mako guda"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "The accounts give the order of what happened on the road, but no days. The pursuit and the tent of Umm Ma‘bad fall somewhere in this week."
msgstr "Ruwayoyin sun ba da jerin abubuwan da suka faru a hanya, amma babu kwanaki. Bin sawu da tantin Umm Ma‘bad sun faru ne a wani lokaci a cikin wannan makon."

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "Arrival at Quba"
msgstr "Isowa Quba"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "Monday · 8 Rabi‘ al-Awwal · 23 September 622"
msgstr "Litinin · 8 Rabi‘ al-Awwal · 23 Satumba 622"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "The account in al-Bukhari says it was a Monday in Rabi‘ al-Awwal. The day of the month is a modern reckoning."
msgstr "Bayanin da ke cikin al-Bukhari ya ce ranar Litinin ce a cikin Rabi'ul Awwal. Ranar watan kuwa lissafi ne na zamani."

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "The stay at Quba"
msgstr "Zama a Quba"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "Four days, or more than ten nights"
msgstr "Kwanaki hudu, ko kuma fiye da dare goma"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "Ibn Ishaq gives Monday to Thursday. The report in al-Bukhari says more than ten nights, and Banu ‘Amr ibn ‘Awf said eighteen. Ibn Kathir sets the reports side by side without settling it."
msgstr "Ibn Ishaq ya ambaci Litinin zuwa Alhamis. Bayanin da ke cikin al-Bukhari ya ce fiye da dare goma, su kuma Banu 'Amr ibn 'Awf sun ce kwana goma sha takwas. Ibn Kathir ya kawo dukkan bayanan tare ba tare da ya zabi guda daya ba."

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "The first Friday, and Madinah"
msgstr "Juma'a ta farko, da kuma Madinah"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "Friday · 12 Rabi‘ al-Awwal · 27 September 622"
msgstr "Juma'a · 12 Rabi'ul Awwal · 27 Satumba 622"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "That it was a Friday is in the early reports. The calendar date is a modern reckoning, and it follows the four-day stay."
msgstr "Kasancewar ranar Juma'a ce yana cikin tsofaffin rahotanni. Ranar kalanda kuwa lissafi ne na zamani, kuma ya biyo bayan zama na kwanaki hudu."

