#: src/content/first-chapter.js
msgid "In Ibn Ishaq’s account, “as it reached me,” ‘Ali stayed behind for another reason too. People in Makkah had left their valuables with the Prophet ﷺ for safekeeping, knowing his honesty; the report says ‘Ali was to return their deposits."
msgstr "A ruwayar Ibn Ishaq, da kalmomin «kamar yadda ya iso gare ni», Ali ya tsaya a baya saboda wani dalili kuma. Mutanen Makka sun kasance suna ajiye dukiyoyinsu wajen Annabi ﷺ domin sun san amincinsa; ruwayar ta ce Ali ne zai mayar musu da amanarsu."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
msgid "Further on they stopped at the tent of Umm Ma‘bad of Khuza‘ah and asked for hospitality. She said they had no food and no milk-giving ewe."
msgstr "Daga baya a hanya suka sauka a tantin Umm Ma'bad 'yar Khuza'a suka nemi karɓar baƙunci. Ta ce ba su da abinci, kuma ba su da tunkiyar da take ba da madara."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
msgid "The report says the Prophet ﷺ called for one of her sheep, passed his hand over its udder and called on Allah. He milked it into a large vessel until it frothed, and said: drink, Umm Ma‘bad. Ibn Kathir notes that her story is well known and comes through routes that strengthen one another."
msgstr "Ruwayar ta ce Annabi ﷺ ya sa aka kawo ɗaya daga cikin tumakinta, ya shafi nononta da hannunsa, ya roƙi Allah. Ya tatsa madararta cikin babban kwano har ta yi kumfa, sannan ya ce: «Ki sha, Umm Ma'bad.» Ibn Kathir ya ambata cewa labarinta sananne ne kuma an ruwaito shi ta hanyoyi masu ƙarfafa juna."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
msgid "According to ‘Urwa, he stayed among them for a few more than ten nights. There he founded the mosque that the account calls the one founded on piety, and he prayed in it."
msgstr "A ruwayar Urwa, ya zauna a cikinsu tsawon wasu darare kaɗan fiye da goma. A can ya kafa masallacin da ruwayar ta ce an kafa shi bisa taƙawa, kuma ya yi salla a cikinsa."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
msgid "They stopped at Umm Ma‘bad’s tent. She said they had no food or milk-giving ewe; the report then describes milk from one of her sheep."
msgstr "Sun sauka a tantin Umm Ma'bad. Ta ce ba su da abinci ko tunkiyar da take ba da madara; sai ruwayar ta bayyana tatsar madara daga ɗaya daga cikin tumakinta."

