#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
msgid "<0>Gathered from the sources.</0> Passages on the Hijrah were collected from the classical Arabic works on Turath, among them Ibn Hisham’s Sirah, Sahih al-Bukhari, Sahih Muslim, al-Bayhaqi’s Dala’il al-Nubuwwa and Ibn Kathir."
msgstr "<0>An tattaro daga madogara.</0> An tattaro nassoshi kan Hijira daga tsofaffin littattafan Turath na Larabci, ciki har da Sirar Ibn Hisham, Sahih al-Bukhari, Sahih Muslim, Dala’il al-Nubuwwa ta al-Bayhaqi da Ibn Kathir."

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
msgid "<0>One Arabic core.</0> The events were set out as records and claims, each tied to the passages that support it. Everything the app says comes from this core."
msgstr "<0>Tushe guda na Larabci.</0> An tsara al'amuran a matsayin bayanai da ka'idoji, kowanne yana da alaka da nassin da ke goyon bayansa. Duk abin da manhajar ta kunsa ya samo asali ne daga wannan tushen."

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
msgid "<0>Translated from the Arabic.</0> The other languages are translated directly from the Arabic, not through English."
msgstr "<0>An fassara daga Larabci.</0> Sauran harsunan an fassara su kai tsaye ne daga Larabci, ba ta hanyar Turanci ba."

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
msgid "<0>Practice from the same evidence.</0> Questions are built on the same claims and passages, so every answer can be checked against its source."
msgstr "<0>Gwaji daga hujjoji guda.</0> An gina tambayoyi a kan bayanai da nassoshi iri daya, domin a iya duba kowace amsa daga asalin madogararta."

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
msgid "<0>Drawn with care.</0> The terrain is real; places and routes are schematic. People are never shown, and animals appear without riders."
msgstr "<0>An zana da kulawa.</0> Yanayin kasa na hakika ne; wurare da hanyoyi zane ne kawai. Ba a nuna mutane ko kadan ba, kuma dabbobi na bayyana ba tare da mahaya ba."

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
msgid "<0>AI, guided by the sources.</0> AI tools helped draft, translate and voice the narration, always working from the Arabic sources."
msgstr "<0>AI, tare da jagorar madogara.</0> Kayan aikin AI sun taimaka wajen tsarawa, fassara da muryar labarin, a kullum ana aiki ne daga madogaran Larabci."

